{"id":"d9cce8d80854a926","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-universal-ml.md","title":"通用 ML 检验存在","display":"thm-universal-ml — 通用 ML 检验存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-universal-ml","aliases":["20-thm-universal-ml"],"display":"thm-universal-ml — 通用 ML 检验存在","chapter":"11","section":"11.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 11.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[221,222],"source_printed_pages":[190,191],"depends_on":["[[20-df-ml-test]]","[[20-df-random]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-universal-ml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-universal-ml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-universal-ml — 通用 ML 检验存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>221</span><span>222</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>190</span><span>191</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>失败集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(U)=\\bigcap_nU_n\">\\(F(U)=\\bigcap_nU_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}ml}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\ (\\operatorname{MLtest}(V)\\Rightarrow F(V)\\subseteq F(U))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}ml}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\ (\\operatorname{MLtest}(V)\\Rightarrow F(V)\\subseteq F(U))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一枚举全部候选开类序列，按有限有理柱测度限制第 e 个候选的第 n 层至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>。将它们移位为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n=\\bigcup_eV^e_{n+e+1}\">\\(U_n=\\bigcup_eV^e_{n+e+1}\\)</span>，测度总和至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>。合法检验不被截断，因而全部失败者被覆盖。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.2.1；印刷页 190, 191；PDF 第 221, 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ml-test","status":"resolved","id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ml-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-random","status":"resolved","id":"238731f42b452fa7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-ml-test","status":"resolved","id":"0f911a6b1b63f977","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-df-random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-random","status":"resolved","id":"238731f42b452fa7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-df-random]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F(U)=\\bigcap_nU_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}universal\\text{-}ml}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\ [\\operatorname{MLtest}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\ (\\operatorname{MLtest}(V)\\Rightarrow F(V)\\subseteq F(U))].","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n=\\bigcup_eV^e_{n+e+1}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false}],"bytes":1158,"backlinks":[{"id":"4da300de847d0dba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"5950e7607222bb8e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-universal-ml]] — 章 11；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-universal-ml]]"}],"outgoing":["0f911a6b1b63f977","238731f42b452fa7"]}